    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "4b9755d5baa456bf02c8": "Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",
        "68dc8b0a00fe9a07f03f": "Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar.",
        "75ddbf17995041be0429": "Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens.",
        "804bfb1b7bd4451dfa41": "In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?",
        "9b2bd68f67abafee2dbd": "Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens.",
        "bd613cf7a66648e20602": "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles."
      },
      "name": "Elder High Mountain",
